  "metaDescription": "Executive Board President Lori Keleher Lori Keleher, Ph.D. is a Professor of Philosophy at New Mexico State University, USA. Her research focus is development ethics, with particular interest in agency, empowerment, and the capabilities approach. She is developing integral human development ethics. With Jay Drydyk, she is the co-editor of The Routledge Handbook of Development…",
