  "bodyText": "Skip to content\n\nIDEA\n\nInternational Development Ethics Association\n\nAbout\nOfficers Board\nBylaws\nPast Events\n \nMember Resources\nJoining IDEA\nOFFICERS BOARD\nExecutive Board\nPresident\nLori Keleher\nVice President\nStacy Kosko\nTreasurer\nMatthew Reagan\nSecretary\nJack Simpson\nBoard of Directors\nNico Brando\nSteve Esquith\nCameron Fioret\nOscar Garza-Vásquez\nVandra Harris Agisilaou\nChristine Koggel\nAnna Malavisi\nLaurent Parrot\nEduardo Rueda\nAmandine Sabourin\nChloe Schwenke\nMario Solís Umaña\nEddy Souffrant\nWelore Tamboura\nJohannes Waldmüller\nDiana Velasco\nAdvisory Board\nLuis Camacho\nJames Crombie\nJean-Luc Dubois\nDes Gasper\nPast Presidents\nDavid Crocker\nNigel Dower\nJay Drydyk\nAsuncion Lera St. Clair\nEric Palmer\n\nFree Download: A comprehensive introduction to development ethics is now available online at no cost: Jay Drydyk & Lori Keleher, eds. The Routledge Handbook of Development Ethics. Routledge Press, 2018.\n\nContact: IDEA Secretary Jack Simpson, jh10j3s@leeds.ac.uk",
